#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey goes beyond the limits of traditional keys, offering a safe, "
"convenient, and modern approach to property access. With <strong>non-"
"copyable key cards</strong> and <strong>secure digital keys</strong> "
"integrated into <strong>Apple and Google Wallets</strong>, SmartphoneKey "
"enhances security for every property type. For anyone looking to upgrade "
"their access control system, now is the perfect time to choose SmartphoneKey"
" and experience a safer, smarter way to protect your property."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey has been designed with various users in mind, from property "
"managers to homeowners and business owners. Here are a few scenarios "
"illustrating how SmartphoneKey provides superior security for different "
"needs:"
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spk_website_v2.page_platform
msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey is an access management platform. Administrators manage sites "
"and access in the Admin Panel. Residents and staff enter with a digital key "
"or a card; visitors scan the entrance QR code to contact a resident or the "
"site team. Readers at the doors apply each change and report what happened."
msgstr ""
"SmartphoneKey est une plateforme de gestion des accès. Les administrateurs "
"gèrent les sites et les accès dans l’Admin Panel. Les résidents et le "
"personnel entrent avec une clé numérique ou une carte ; les visiteurs "
"scannent le code QR de l’entrée pour contacter un résident ou l’équipe du "
"site. Les lecteurs aux portes appliquent chaque modification et signalent ce"
" qui s’est passé."

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spk_website_v2.page_platform
msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey is an access management platform. It combines the Admin Panel,"
" Wallet keys and NFC cards, SmartphoneKey readers with a built-in access "
"controller, and connected-device scenarios, so teams can manage access "
"across their sites."
msgstr ""
"SmartphoneKey est une plateforme de gestion des accès. Elle réunit l’Admin "
"Panel, les clés Wallet et les cartes NFC, les lecteurs SmartphoneKey à "
"contrôleur d’accès intégré et des scénarios d’appareils connectés, pour que "
"les équipes gèrent les accès de tous leurs sites."

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_smart_home_trends_2025_the_future_of_secure_and_connected_living
msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey is designed to <strong>modernize old intercom setups</strong> "
"without the need for full hardware replacements, reducing electronic waste "
"and supporting <strong>eco-friendly smart home advancements.</strong>"
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_smart_home_trends_2025_the_future_of_secure_and_connected_living
msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey is designed to integrate with <strong>AI-powered home "
"ecosystems</strong>, offering <strong>intelligent, automated access "
"control</strong> that enhances security and convenience."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_welcome_to_smartphonekey_your_affordable_access_to_a_keyless_future
msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey is more than just an access control system. It’s a "
"comprehensive solution that offers multiple benefits:"
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_smart_home_trends_2025_the_future_of_secure_and_connected_living
